e="width: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span><span class="flex-1 text-[13px] font-medium text-text truncate min-w-0">Issues</span></button><button class="flex items-center gap-3 w-full pl-6 pr-3 transition-colors text-left" style="height: 36px; border-left: 3px solid transparent;"><span class="shrink-0 text-ink-600" style="width: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg></span><span class="flex-1 text-[13px] font-medium text-text truncate min-w-0">Results</span></button><button title="Queue saved projects to solve sequentially in the background; results persist to disk." class="flex items-center gap-3 w-full pl-6 pr-3 transition-colors text-left" style="height: 36px; border-left: 3px solid transparent;"><span class="shrink-0 text-ink-600" style="width: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-list-checks" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m3 17 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="m3 7 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="M13 6h8"></path><path d="M13 12h8"></path><path d="M13 18h8"></path></svg></span><span class="flex-1 text-[13px] font-medium text-text truncate min-w-0">Solve Queue</span></button></div><button data-testid="sidebar-section-studies" class="flex items-center justify-between w-full px-4 py-2 mt-1 text-left hover:bg-panel transition-colors"><span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-ink-400">STUDIES</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-ink-400 transition-transform duration-200 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" style="transform: rotate(0deg);"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="pb-1"><button title="Rank a year's extreme hours, screen N-1/N-2 and fault levels, and export PowerFactory handoff bundles (gridspine)." class="flex items-center gap-3 w-full pl-6 pr-3 transition-colors text-left" style="height: 36px; border-left: 3px solid transparent;"><span class="shrink-0 text-ink-600" style="width: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-flask-conical" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2"></path><path d="M6.453 15h11.094"></path><path d="M8.5 2h7"></path></svg></span><span class="flex-1 text-[13px] font-medium text-text truncate min-w-0">Planning → dynamics</span></button><button title="Take a solved hub to its electrical design: transformers, reactive compensation, short circuit and PCC grid-code compliance at the critical hours (AC load flow)." class="flex items-center gap-3 w-full pl-6 pr-3 transition-colors text-left" style="height: 36px; border-left: 3px solid transparent;"><span class="shrink-0 text-ink-600" style="width: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15